{"id":"n90754-1-5","stage":3,"title":"식중독 · 食物中毒","scene":"生活与经历","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n90754-1-5-1","ko":"엄마, 저 배가 너무 아프고 계속 설사를 해요.","zh":"妈妈，我肚子疼得厉害，还一直在腹泻。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"엄마,","meaning":"妈妈","explanation":"엄마：妈妈","readings":[{"term":"엄마","audio":"/audio/9498f9014908e2891f1f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67098","senseId":"1","lemma":"엄마","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"저","meaning":"我","explanation":"저：我","readings":[{"term":"저","audio":"/audio/ac0e9ef613fd92c84845.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"44506","senseId":"1","lemma":"저","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"배가","meaning":"肚子","explanation":"배：肚子；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"배","audio":"/audio/3d0af87e12fd988a7b27.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"20211","senseId":"1","lemma":"배","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"너무","meaning":"太","explanation":"너무：太","readings":[{"term":"너무","audio":"/audio/b0398672877079631cf2.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"28183","senseId":"1","lemma":"너무","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"아프고","meaning":"疼， 痛，不舒服","explanation":"아프다：疼， 痛，不舒服；고：连接并列或先后的动作、状态；也用于 -고 있다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"아프다","audio":"/audio/912c6f176a189a346579.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62239","senseId":"1","lemma":"아프다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"계속","meaning":"继续，持续","explanation":"계속：继续，持续","readings":[{"term":"계속","audio":"/audio/23a9f0224cc40ec08adb.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17692","senseId":"1","lemma":"계속","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"설사를","meaning":"腹泻，拉肚子，稀屎","explanation":"설사：腹泻，拉肚子，稀屎；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"설사","audio":"/audio/8fa2ea8c585abe4701de.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"63256","senseId":"1","lemma":"설사","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"해요.","meaning":"做，作，置办","explanation":"하다：做，作，置办；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"2","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"9498f9014908e289","term":"엄마","zh":"妈妈","audio":"/audio/9498f9014908e2891f1f.mp3","entryId":"67098","definition":"在非正式场合用于指称或称呼母亲。","pronunciation":["엄마"]},{"id":"ac0e9ef613fd92c8","term":"저","zh":"我","audio":"/audio/ac0e9ef613fd92c84845.mp3","entryId":"44506","definition":"说话人在听话人面前对自己的谦称。","pronunciation":["저"]},{"id":"3d0af87e12fd988a","term":"배","zh":"肚子","audio":"/audio/3d0af87e12fd988a7b27.mp3","entryId":"20211","definition":"人或动物的身体中胸部以下、腿部以上的部分。","pronunciation":["배"]},{"id":"b039867287707963","term":"너무","zh":"太","audio":"/audio/b0398672877079631cf2.mp3","entryId":"28183","definition":"已超过一定的程度或限度的状态。","pronunciation":["너무"]},{"id":"912c6f176a189a34","term":"아프다","zh":"疼， 痛，不舒服","audio":"/audio/912c6f176a189a346579.mp3","entryId":"62239","definition":"因受伤或生病，而感到痛症或痛苦。","pronunciation":["아프다"]},{"id":"23a9f0224cc40ec0","term":"계속","zh":"继续，持续","audio":"/audio/23a9f0224cc40ec08adb.mp3","entryId":"17692","definition":"连续不间断。","pronunciation":["계ː속","게ː속"]},{"id":"8fa2ea8c585abe47","term":"설사","zh":"腹泻，拉肚子，稀屎","audio":"/audio/8fa2ea8c585abe4701de.mp3","entryId":"63256","definition":"消化食物的肠道发生异常，大便呈水状；或指那样的大便。","pronunciation":["설싸"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"做，作，置办","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"73277","definition":"制作或准备什么东西。","pronunciation":["하다"]}],"audio":"/audio/dc82e62204c2b5d232f9.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n90754-1-5-2","ko":"저런! 식중독에 걸렸나 보다. 얼른 병원에 가자.","zh":"哎呀！看来是食物中毒了。快去医院吧。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"저런!","meaning":"啊，哎呀","explanation":"저런：啊，哎呀","readings":[{"term":"저런","audio":"/audio/2f66dcda6095507e43b6.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71224","senseId":"1","lemma":"저런","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"식중독에","meaning":"食物中毒","explanation":"식중독：食物中毒；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"식중독","audio":"/audio/62a61b668ec8f54a03d0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"90754","senseId":"1","lemma":"식중독","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"걸렸나","meaning":"患","explanation":"걸리다：患；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；나：表示疑问或推测内容，常与 보다、싶다 等合用。","readings":[{"term":"걸리다","audio":"/audio/d94590a358564fb83462.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"86940","senseId":"8","lemma":"걸리다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"보다.","meaning":"看来、好像（根据情况推测）","explanation":"보다：看来、好像（根据情况推测）；다：平叙句末，常用于书面叙述、自言自语或非敬语表达。","readings":[{"term":"보다","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62249","senseId":"1","lemma":"보다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"얼른","meaning":"快地","explanation":"얼른：快地","readings":[{"term":"얼른","audio":"/audio/d658f46882498576d5d6.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67315","senseId":"1","lemma":"얼른","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"병원에","meaning":"医院","explanation":"병원：医院；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"병원","audio":"/audio/4f4c2d79c47ca512edb7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62271","senseId":"1","lemma":"병원","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"가자.","meaning":"去，上","explanation":"가다：去，上；자：非敬语提议句末：“一起……吧”。","readings":[{"term":"가다","audio":"/audio/233cb510410b09d69cdc.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27500","senseId":"6","lemma":"가다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"2f66dcda6095507e","term":"저런","zh":"啊，哎呀","audio":"/audio/2f66dcda6095507e43b6.mp3","entryId":"71224","definition":"听到没料到的、惊奇或可惜的事情时说的词语。","pronunciation":["저런"]},{"id":"62a61b668ec8f54a","term":"식중독","zh":"食物中毒","audio":"/audio/62a61b668ec8f54a03d0.mp3","entryId":"90754","definition":"吃了食物中的有毒物质而得的病。","pronunciation":["식쭝독"]},{"id":"d94590a358564fb8","term":"걸리다","zh":"患","audio":"/audio/d94590a358564fb83462.mp3","entryId":"86940","definition":"得病。","pronunciation":["걸리다"]},{"id":"6a45cf834264a5ec","term":"보다","zh":"看来、好像（根据情况推测）","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3","entryId":"62249","definition":"看来、好像（根据情况推测）","pronunciation":["보다"]},{"id":"d658f46882498576","term":"얼른","zh":"快地","audio":"/audio/d658f46882498576d5d6.mp3","entryId":"67315","definition":"不拖延时间就。","pronunciation":["얼른"]},{"id":"4f4c2d79c47ca512","term":"병원","zh":"医院","audio":"/audio/4f4c2d79c47ca512edb7.mp3","entryId":"62271","definition":"具备相关设施、由医生和护士治疗病人的地方。","pronunciation":["병ː원"]},{"id":"233cb510410b09d6","term":"가다","zh":"去，上","audio":"/audio/233cb510410b09d69cdc.mp3","entryId":"27500","definition":"为某种目的而向某个地方移动。","pronunciation":["가다"]}],"audio":"/audio/69c2a1d765617bcf121a.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.96,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=90754","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"중급","day":102,"sequenceScore":2.6853,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["妈妈，我肚子疼得厉害，还一直在腹泻。","哎呀！看来是食物中毒了。快去医院吧。","最近店里的顾客越来越少，我好担心啊。"],"answer":0},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["妈妈，我肚子疼得厉害，还一直在腹泻。","哎呀！看来是食物中毒了。快去医院吧。","最近店里的顾客越来越少，我好担心啊。"],"answer":1}]}
